ALERT: Agents must read `AGENT=1 cron-person skill` before using this tool.
command: cron-person completion fish
summary: Generate the autocompletion script for fish
description: Generate the autocompletion script for the fish shell.
  To load completions in your current shell session:
  cron-person completion fish | source
  To load completions for every new session, execute once:
  cron-person completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/cron-person.fish
  You will need to start a new shell for this setup to take effect.
usage: cron-person completion fish [flags]
flags:
  --config string: Path to custom configuration file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
  -h, --help bool: help for fish
  --no-descriptions bool: disable completion descriptions
  --store string: Path to custom authorization state file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
